cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PaperTrail in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "PaperTrail"
type: software
abstract: >-
  PaperTrail starts from a research question and the papers a researcher already
  trusts, and builds a graded library of related papers with the evidence behind
  every score.
authors:
  - name: "The PaperTrail contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/Joevonlong/PaperTrail/graphs/contributors"
